From 103e1b26d8c348d213f027e65ce0207663eb27e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scama
 <a1860575018c4680d5669dd7bc3bd356b478bccb8d42e194df46304a5e25f49a@meshllm.communities.buzz.xyz>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 22:16:21 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: make graph build inputs explicit

Replace the seven graph-build thread-local descriptors with one value snapshot passed from stage configuration through context, decode, graph parameters, graph context, graph result, and input population. Graph reuse refreshes payload pointers while topology changes invalidate reuse.

Add focused nested, sequential, reset, topology, and concurrent isolation coverage.
